# tyre-stock agent rules

- Stack: Flutter Web. Main logic in `lib/main.dart`; XLSX in `lib/xlsx_reader.dart`.
- **Never reintroduce the `excel` package** — use custom ZIP/XML reader.
- Duplicate tyres merge via `_upsertTyre` (brand+size+pattern+year); sum `st`.
- Live site is **`gh-pages`**, not `master`. Build with:
  `flutter build web --base-href /tyre-stock/`
- UI copy: Traditional Chinese. Default PIN `250183418`.
- See root `AGENTS.md` for full deploy/landmine notes.
